<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13281" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dē-rādo</span></b> , si, sum,
		3, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. a.,
				to rub</i> or <i>scrape off, to smooth off, shave
				off</i> (anteclass. and post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">de virga lauri deradito,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato R.
					R. 121</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">atramentum scalpro,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 8,
					4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">5, 26, 35</span></i>;
			cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ceram,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 17, 9, 17</span></i>
			; and: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nomen urbis ex carmine,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 7,
					20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">umorem specillis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					32, 7, 24, § 75</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corticem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					20, 2, 6, § 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cunctis margo derasis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Ep. 8, 20, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">capillum ex capite omni,</span>”
				<i>to cut off</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 17, 9, 22</span></i>
			, for which also caput, <i><span class="en">id. ib.</span></i> § 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">25: deraso capite,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					29, 6, 34, § 109</span></i>
			.</div>
